  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量营销-人群定向、DMP 与 RTA\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量营销\"],\"capability_summary\":\"每个人群包生成人群包id后，需经过推送才可在被推送客户下使用，同时可将人群包共享给同主体的客户。可通过【人群包详细信息】查询人群包状态。推送的客户列表主体需与人群包所属客户主体一致，经过拓展/运算的新id需再次推送。\",\"id\":\"ad.dmp_custom_audience.push\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/dmp/custom_audience/push_v2/\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"official_url\":\"1696710572311552\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"ad.dmp_custom_audience.get_detail\",\"path\":\"/open_api/2/dmp/custom_audience/get_detail/\",\"reason\":\"可通过此接口查询人群包的状态\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"人群包详细信息\"},{\"id\":\"open_api.get_access_token\",\"path\":\"\",\"reason\":\"推送人群包时需要使用授权的access-token，需先通过此接口获取\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access-Token\"},{\"id\":\"appendix.return_code\",\"path\":\"\",\"reason\":\"推送人群包的应答参数中返回码和返回信息的说明需参考此文档\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"附录-返回码\"}],\"risk_level\":\"medium\",\"schema_url\":\"1696710572311552\",\"title\":\"推送人群包\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-c3eisEEL\">每个人群包生成一个人群包id后，都需要经过推送，才可以在被推送的客户下使用。同时，推送人群包可以将人群包共享给同主体的客户。</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-X8R4drkN\">您可以通过<a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710571259916\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\">【人群包详细信息】</a>查询人群包的状态，其中返回参数<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">delivery_status</code>表征当前人群包可投放状态（包含是否推送完成）；</p><div data-type=\"qzcard\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22borderColor%22%3A%22%23fed4a4%22%2C%22backgroundColor%22%3A%22%23fff5eb%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cul%20data-id%3D%5C%22u738a58b-6ol9vK3j%5C%22%3E%3Cli%20data-id%3D%5C%22ld70c578-UOULhLNn%5C%22%3E%E6%8E%A8%E9%80%81%E7%9A%84%E5%B9%BF%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%BB%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E4%B8%8E%E4%BA%BA%E7%BE%A4%E5%8C%85%E6%89%80%E5%B1%9E%E5%B9%BF%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%BB%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%E4%B8%80%E8%87%B4%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%20data-id%3D%5C%22ld70c578-sUP3ugfe%5C%22%3E%E7%BB%8F%E8%BF%87%E6%8B%93%E5%B1%95%2F%E8%BF%90%E7%AE%97%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%E7%BE%A4%E5%8C%85%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E4%BA%86%E6%96%B0%E7%9A%84id%EF%BC%8C%E6%84%8F%E5%91%B3%E7%9D%80%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E5%B0%86%E6%96%B0%E7%9A%84id%E5%86%8D%E6%AC%A1%E6%8E%A8%E9%80%81%E4%B8%80%E9%81%8D!%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%20data-id%3D%5C%22ld70c578-E7LUKQNa%5C%22%3E%E5%92%8C%E4%BA%BA%E7%BE%A4%E5%8C%85%E5%8F%91%E5%B8%83%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%EF%BC%8C%E5%A6%82%E6%9E%9C%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7%E5%9F%BA%E4%BA%8E%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E6%BA%90%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%86%E6%96%B0%E5%A2%9E%2F%E5%88%A0%E9%99%A4%2F%E9%87%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E4%BC%9A%E5%AF%BC%E8%87%B4%E5%AF%B9%E5%BA%94%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%E7%BE%A4%E5%8C%85id%E5%8F%98%E5%8C%96